<title>USA: Bank/NY sells 5 pct stake in Wing Hang Bank.</title>
<headline>Bank/NY sells 5 pct stake in Wing Hang Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co Inc said Friday it had agreed to sell a five percent stake in Wing Hang Bank of Hong Kong to a wholly owned subsidiary of Singapore Technologies Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bank of New York said the sale, consisting of 12.25 million Wing Hang shares, will reduce its ownership in Wing Hang to 25 percent, which it said it would continue to hold.</p>
<p>Bank of New York acquired an interest in Wing Hang in 1973.</p>
<p>Wing Hang was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange in 1993.</p>
</text>
